{"id":"00183","root":"uni00183_1","name":{"ja":"レーベ・サフリー","en":"Loewe Saffrey"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"レーベ・サフリー","en":"Loewe Saffrey"},"element":"Science","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2019-04-15","limited":false,"characterId":144,"profile":{"ja":"無類の戦闘狂であり、米連に無理やり自分を売り込み、兵装を手に入れ、所属の兵士となった。それ以来、戦闘がある度に自発的に参加し、敵をせん滅していくため、米連も評価に困っているものの、兵器の実戦データの入手と兵力を兼ねているため、好待遇となっている。本人自体は、戦闘ができればよく、戦場の中で死ねるのなら本望だと思っている。戦場にしか生きがいは無く、完全に戦意を喪失した敵を犯す事で、生を実感している。兵装であるフォトンサイスを相棒と呼び、鎌と身一つで戦場を駆け抜ける狂気の死神と呼ばれている。狂気と快楽、死の臨場感でしか満足する事ができず、戦場が無い時は死んだように眠っている。そのため、趣味と呼ばれるものは全くと言って皆無であり、殺し方の研究や、サイスの調整をすること以外にすることはない。","en":"Loewe Saffrey is an unparalleled battle maniac who forced herself onto the United States, procured weaponry, and became a soldier of the forces. Since then, she voluntarily joins every combat, annihilating enemies, leaving the U.S. perplexed by how to evaluate her, yet rewarding her because she provides real-world data and manpower. She herself believes that as long as she can fight, she's fulfilled, and dying on the battlefield would be her ultimate wish. She finds purpose only on the front lines, feeling truly alive when she subjugates enemies who have lost all will to fight. She calls her weapon, the Photon Scythe, a partner, and is dubbed a mad death god who races across battlefields wielding only a scythe and her own body. She can only be satisfied by madness, pleasure, and the visceral thrill of death; when no war is present, she sleeps as if dead. Consequently, she has no hobbies whatsoever, devoting herself solely to researching killing methods and adjusting her scythe."},"illustrator":"ZOL","voiceActor":"あかしゆき","forms":[{"id":"uni00183_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[782,1564],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[114,228],"def":[91,182],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","160009"]},{"id":"uni00183_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1164,2328],"sp":[210,210]